[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/glitchmission01/text",
    "raw": "This keep belongs to a Glitch known as the Baron. He is a retired hero, and by all accounts a little... Eccentric...He spends his retirement seeking strange and unusual artifacts for his collection.",
    "value": "这座城堡属于一位被称为拜隆男爵的电子人。他曾是一位退役的英雄，据说性格有些....古怪...退休后，他致力于搜寻各种奇珍异宝，丰富自己的收藏。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/glitchmission01a/text",
    "raw": "He may have a few screws loose, dear, but he's not dangerous. He's' ^green;absolutely certain^reset; that this keep houses an ^red;ancient and terrible artifact^reset; and spends a fortune investigating.",
    "value": "亲爱的，他可能脑子有点不正常，但绝不危险。他^green;坚信^reset;这座城堡里藏着一件^red;古老而可怕的宝物^reset;，为此不惜花费巨资进行调查。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/glitchmission01b/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/glitchmission01b/text",
    "raw": "There may be some truth to this, based on rumors I've heard over the last ninety years. Maybe there is something hidden in the ^green;foundation^reset;?",
    "value": "根据我过去九十年间听到的传闻，这话或许有几分道理。难道^green;地基^reset;里真的藏着什么秘密？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/glitchmission02/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/glitchmission02/text",
    "raw": "Well I'll be damned. The Baron was right. This must be the switch for the rumored 'secret' of the Keep. Be sure to get some scans of whatever you find. I'm really curious what you'll discover here!",
    "value": "真是难以置信，拜伦男爵说得没错。这肯定就是传闻中城堡“秘密”的开关。记得把你找到的任何东西都扫描下来，我太好奇你在这儿会发现什么了！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lunarbase04/text",
    "raw": "Erchius readings have reached 94 rad. You are in grave peril. My programming requires me to inform you that proceeding could prove dangerous. Use extreme caution.",
    "value": "厄尔吉斯辐射读数已达94拉德。你正处于极度危险之中。根据程序设定，我必须提醒你继续前进可能带来致命风险。请务必万分小心。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lunarbase05/text",
    "raw": "Prolonged contact with the Erchius crystals seems to have denatured their very being! Curious. The creatures have lost themselves completely.",
    "value": "长时间接触厄尔吉斯晶体似乎改变了它们的本质！真是奇妙。这些生物已经完全迷失了自我。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lunarbase06/text",
    "raw": "Erchius readings have reached 101 rad. I am also reading something massive below. ^red;WARNING: Continuing may to prove fatal. Are you sure you wish to proceed^reset;?",
    "value": "厄尔吉斯辐射读数已达101拉德。下方探测到巨大物体。^red;警告：继续前进可能致命。确认要继续吗^reset;？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lunarbase07/text",
    "raw": "Conventional weapons will have nearly no effect on the Erchius crystal. You'll most likely need to devise another means of attack.",
    "value": "常规武器对厄尔吉斯晶体几乎无效。你很可能需要另寻攻击手段。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lunarbase08a/text",
    "raw": "There is enough Erchius here to power the Outpost for quite a long time. ^orange;Great work, Agent^reset;! This will greatly help the Protectorate to reform.",
    "value": "这里的厄尔吉斯矿储量足以支撑前哨站运行很长一段时间。^orange;干得漂亮，干员^reset;！这将极大地助守护团的重建进程。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/floranmission101/text",
    "raw": "These ruins are ancient and appear to be sacred to the Floran for, I'd guess, religious reasons. Readings show they are also dark and ominous.",
    "value": "这些遗迹年代久远，从宗教角度推测，它们对叶族人而言似乎具有神圣意义。探测数据显示，此地同样笼罩着黑暗与不祥的气息。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/floranmission102/text",
    "raw": "Bio readings show many lifesigns in these tunnels. Unfortunately, approximately 97% are hostile. I commend your valour.",
    "value": "生物读数显示这些隧道中存在大量生命迹象。不幸的是，其中约97%具有敌意。我钦佩你的勇气。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/floranmission103/text",
    "raw": "What a feisty Floran! Reminds me of myself when I was younger, though I had fewer leaves. Hopefully we can trust this one",
    "value": "真是个火辣的叶族人！让我想起了年轻时的自己，虽然那时我的叶子还没这么多。希望我们能信任这家伙。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/floranmission104/text",
    "raw": "It is evident that these Floran are after something of grave cultural significance to them. They're worse than me on a bug hunt! Be careful, dear.",
    "value": "显然，这些叶族人正在追寻对他们具有重大文化意义的东西。他们追捕起来比我在猎虫时还要疯狂！小心点，亲爱的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/apexmission01/text",
    "raw": "Our arrival appears to coincide with a rebel attack against the Miniknog. This is to both our advantage for the Protectorate to provide aid.",
    "value": "我们抵达的时机恰逢反抗军对科学发展部袭击。这对我们来说是个有利条件，因为守护团可以借此机会提供援助。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/apexmission02a/text",
    "raw": "I am detecting numerous additional hostiles ahead, armed with what appear to be rather dangerous armaments.",
    "value": "前方探测到大量新增敌对目标，其装备的武器似乎相当危险。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/apexmission06a/text",
    "raw": "Big Ape is a profoundly dangerous enemy, but is still vulnerable to weapons. Cut the head off the snake, and the Miniknog may crumble!",
    "value": "老大猿真是个极其危险的敌人，但仍能被武器所伤。斩断蛇首，科技发展部或许会土崩瓦解！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/hylotlmission03a/text",
    "raw": "Something about these cultists is setting off alarm bells. There is an eerie resemblance to something that I just can't place...",
    "value": "这些邪教徒身上有些地方让我警铃大作。他们与某种事物有着诡异的相似之处，我却怎么也想不起来..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/tentaclemission-bossroom/text",
    "raw": "You've reached what appears to be the nerve center for this titanic monstrosity. This is it, now. Destroy the beast or we all perish!",
    "value": "你已抵达这庞然巨兽的核心中枢。就是这里，现在！摧毁这头怪物，否则我们都将灭亡！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormissionspecial/text",
    "raw": "There appears to be some sort of interesting technology suspended above that device. I recommend immediate investigation.",
    "value": "那台设备上方似乎悬浮着某种有趣的科技装置，我建议你立即展开调查。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission1/text",
    "raw": "I'm not sure where this teleporter has dropped us off. I am, however, detecting unknown signals up ahead somewhere. You should investigate, and find a way out.",
    "value": "我不确定这个传送器把我们送到了哪里。不过，我探测到前方某处有未知信号。你应该去探查一下，并找到出路。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission2/text",
    "raw": "This is of truly ancient design. The door appears sealed, but might open to sufficient explosive force.",
    "value": "这扇门的设计确实极为古老。看似封闭，但或许足够强大的爆炸力能将其打开。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission3/text",
    "raw": "It is highly likely that these ruins have not been accessed in thousands of years. I wonder what mysteries await?",
    "value": "这些遗迹很可能已有数千年无人踏足。不知其中隐藏着怎样的秘密？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission4/text",
    "raw": "Ahead I detect several meters of weakened material. You could try digging through and see how that goes.",
    "value": "前方探测到几米厚的脆弱材料层。你可以尝试挖掘过去，看看情况如何。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission5/text",
    "raw": "Another red door. Smash it!",
    "value": "又是一扇红门。砸开它！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission6/text",
    "raw": "The door here appears to be triggered remotely by something. I can only faintly read connections to some sort of sensor.",
    "value": "这里的门似乎是由某种远程装置触发的。我只能隐约辨认出它与某种传感器相连。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission7/text",
    "raw": "Something must trigger this small door. We should probably hunt around elsewhere and see what we can find.",
    "value": "一定有什么东西触发了这扇小门。我们最好在别处搜寻一下，看看能找到什么线索。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission8/text",
    "raw": "This room was painstakingly hidden from casual view. There must be something above worth investigating.",
    "value": "这间屋子被精心隐藏，不易被轻易发现。其中必有值得探究的奥秘。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission9/text",
    "raw": "It seems we have more to explore! I am detecting numerous hostile IFF readings below your position, so do take precautions.",
    "value": "看来我们还有更多需要探索的地方！我侦测到你下方有大量敌对识别信号，请务必小心行事。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission10/text",
    "raw": "Impossible. This ship is still functioning, albeit at vastly reduced capacity. It is unlikely that it could travel, but we could certainly learn something from its systems!",
    "value": "不可思议。这艘船仍在运作，尽管功能已大幅减弱。它或许无法航行，但我们肯定能从它的系统中有所收获！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission11/text",
    "raw": "I believe this switch is linked to systems elsewhere in the facility. We should backtrack and see what has opened up once we've activated the console.",
    "value": "我认为这个开关与设施内其他区域的系统相连。我们应该先返回，看看激活控制台后有什么被开启了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission12/text",
    "raw": "Readings are scattered here. These machines are likely interfering with the signal. I cannot detect lifesigns or robotic signatures accurately. Extreme caution is advised.",
    "value": "读数在此处分散。这些机器很可能在干扰信号。我无法准确探测到生命迹象或机器人特征。建议极度谨慎行事。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission13/text",
    "raw": "While its actual function is somewhat of a mystery, this unusual device appears capable of infusing weapons, armor and other gear with cosmic energies. I imagine with it, one could vastly improve gear quality.",
    "value": "尽管其实际功能尚存几分神秘，但这件奇特的装置似乎能够为武器、盔甲及其他装备注入宇宙能量。可以想见，借助它，装备的品质将得到极大提升。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursormission14/text",
    "raw": "We appear to be well and truly trapped. The way back has been blocked. I am also detecting an extremely powerful machine nearby, and it appears to be targetting your specific DNA.",
    "value": "我们似乎真的被困住了。退路已被封死。我还探测到附近有一台极其强大的机器，它似乎正在锁定你的特定DNA。"
  },
