  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs101a/text",
    "raw": "My name is Generic Omnipresent Voice, or GOV for short. While you are in the facility, I will be your guiding authority.",
    "value": "我的名字是“千种用途且哪里都在的声音”，简称千里音。我负责在这个设施里为您提供指导。"
