    "path": "/extrachallengelabs102/text",
    "raw": "Contained within this chest is a Tool For Spatial Transference Of Living Matter, or in layman's terms, a Relocator. Please retrieve it. It will be required for testing.",
    "value": "此箱内装有一件“活体物质空间转移工具”，通俗来说，即“迁跃器”。请将其取出，后续测试需使用此设备。"
