  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs104/text",
    "raw": "Friendship with Companion Punchy established and online. Friendship levels detected at 13.3 percent.",
    "value": "与强力伙伴的友谊已建立并上线。检测到友谊等级为13.3%。"
