  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs104a/text",
    "raw": "Teamwork is mandatory in the testing facility. Non-compliance will not be tolerated and you will be penalised for failure to display a sufficient teamwork exponent.",
    "value": "在测试设施中，团队合作是强制要求。不遵守规定将不被容忍，若未能展现出足够的团队协作能力，您将受到相应处罚。"
