  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs105/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs105/text",
    "raw": "Success! Teamwork levels are now non-negligible. Please enjoy a moment in the Comfort Chamber with your Companion Punchy before proceeding.",
    "value": "成功！团队协作水平现已不容忽视。请在继续前进之前，与您的强力伙伴在舒适室中享受片刻时光。"
