  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs106/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs106/text",
    "raw": "Your Companion Punchy is more durable than appearances might otherwise suggest. It will bleed, burn, and die for you so that you don't have to.",
    "value": "您的强力伙伴比看起来更加坚韧耐用。它会为你流血、燃烧，甚至牺牲，只为让你安然无恙。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs106a/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs106a/text",
    "raw": "Your Companion Punchy's loyalty exponent is currently 6. Should it drop to zero, sleep with one eye open.",
    "value": "你的伙伴强力伙伴当前忠诚指数为6。若降至零，您睡觉都不敢闭眼睛。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs107/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs107/text",
    "raw": "These sensors are calibrated to detect only Companion Punchys, greed, faith, and hatred.",
    "value": "这些传感器经过校准，仅能探测到强力伙伴、贪婪、信仰以及仇恨。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs108/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs108/text",
    "raw": "Contact with the Steele Tech(TM) energy lances will invariably result in vaporisation.",
    "value": "与斯蒂尔科技(TM)能量长矛接触，必将导致物体瞬间汽化。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs108a/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs108a/text",
    "raw": "Happily, Companion Punchys are made of sugar, spice, everything nice, and chemical X, rendering them impervious to vaporisation.",
    "value": "幸运的是，强力伙伴是由糖、香料、一切美好的东西以及化合物X制成，这使得它们能够抵御汽化作用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs109/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs109/text",
    "raw": "Entertain me.",
    "value": "逗我开心呢。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs110/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs110/text",
    "raw": "Alas, this is the end of a beautiful friendship. Incinerate your Companion Punchy to continue. Only one of you may leave the facility alive.",
    "value": "唉，一段美好的友谊就此终结。焚毁你的强力伙伴才能继续前进。你们之中，只有一人能活着离开此地。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs111/senderName",
    "raw": "???",
    "value": "???"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/extrachallengelabs111/text",
    "raw": "Yes...I think it's about time for a very palatable reward...for a traitor like you. Enjoy it while you can. GOV out.",
    "value": "是的....我想是时候给你一个非常“可口”的奖赏了....像你这样的叛徒。趁还能享受的时候好好品味吧。别管当局了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/japaneseruins01/text",
    "raw": "Hmm. If you are stuck, examining objects may yield valuable information on how to proceed, even if said objects appear familiar.",
    "value": "嗯。如果你卡住了，仔细检查物品或许能提供如何继续前进的宝贵线索，即使那些物品看起来似曾相识。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafacility01/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafacility01/text",
    "raw": "The entire facility appears to be surrounded by a jamming signal. I won't be able to get to you once you get any closer, so you'll be on your own.",
    "value": "整个设施似乎被一种干扰信号所笼罩。一旦你靠近，我就无法再联系到你，接下来只能靠你自己了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafacility01a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafacility01a/text",
    "raw": "Good luck, soldier. I get the feeling you'll need it. Letheia doesn't mess around when it comes to its security.",
    "value": "祝你好运，士兵。我有预感你会需要这份运气的。莱西亚在安保方面可从不含糊。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafleet01/text",
    "raw": "Scans indicate the corporate fleet consists of a battleship, a carrier, a tanker, and numerous other small vessels.",
    "value": "扫描结果显示，企业舰队包括一艘战列舰、一艘航空母舰、一艘油轮以及众多其他小型船只。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafleet01a/text",
    "raw": "In order to board the battleship's main segment, you will need to activate IFF signals on the bridges of the carrier and tanker.",
    "value": "要登上战舰的主体部分，您需要激活航母和油轮桥梁上的敌我识别信号。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafleet01b/text",
    "raw": "Due to the size of the fleet, your mech's initial energy reserves may be insufficient, especially if you sustain damage from their defenses.",
    "value": "由于舰队规模庞大，你的机甲初始能量储备可能不足，尤其是在遭受敌方防御系统攻击后。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/letheiafleet01c/text",
    "raw": "Boarding ships and raiding their energy stores may very well be crucial to your success. Good luck.",
    "value": "登船并夺取其能源储备，对你的成功至关重要。祝你好运。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/verdantruins01/text",
    "raw": "My scans of the ruins suggest that you'll need the double jump or some iteration thereof to successfully traverse the ruins. Remember to have such equipped.",
    "value": "根据我对遗迹的扫描分析，你需要具备二段跳或类似能力才能顺利穿越这片废墟。请务必确保装备了此类技能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/verdantruins02/text",
    "raw": "It may also be prudent to acquire some means of surviving great falls. Perhaps you'll find one if you search nearby?",
    "value": "或许，寻找一些能在高处坠落时保命的方法也是明智之举。不妨在附近找找看，说不定会有发现？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration01/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration01/text",
    "raw": "Rebel intelligence indicates that you'll need the Micro Spider Sphere or better to effect entry into the facility. We've provided a console for you to swap it in, if you forgot.",
    "value": "反抗军的情报显示，你需要微型蜘蛛球或更高级的科技才能进入设施。如果你忘了，我们已经为你准备了更换控制台。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration01a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration01a/text",
    "raw": "Before you do anything else, though, check in with the forward team leader and get further details of the task at hand.",
    "value": "不过，在做其他事情之前，先与前方团队负责人沟通，获取当前任务的更多细节。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration02/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration02/text",
    "raw": "There're the remains of earlier Miniknog facilities in the area. They ought to be mostly abandoned... mostly.",
    "value": "这片区域还残留着早期科学发展部设施的遗迹。它们应该大多已被废弃...至少大部分如此。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration02a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration02a/text",
    "raw": "I suppose you could take this path if you wanted to avoid detection... although the old security systems are likely to have gone haywire.",
    "value": "如果你想避开监控的话，或许可以走这条路...不过那些老旧的安保系统可能已经失控了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration03/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration03/text",
    "raw": "You're not going to eat what you find in that ancient fridge, are you? Who knows how long that's been in there, and in so toxic an environment!",
    "value": "你不会真要吃那个旧冰箱里的东西吧？谁知道那玩意儿在里面放了多久，而且环境还那么糟糕！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration03a/senderName",
    "raw": "Nuru",
    "value": "努鲁"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration03a/text",
    "raw": "Ssayss the guy who drinkss Letheia Cola.",
    "value": "这句话话话出自一个喝喝喝莱西亚可乐的人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration03b/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration03b/text",
    "raw": "That's different!",
    "value": "那能一样吗！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration04/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration04/text",
    "raw": "Wow, will you look at that! Just what warrants all these danger signs?",
    "value": "哇，快看那边！到底是什么情况需要这么多警示标志？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration04a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration04a/text",
    "raw": "Who knows what kind of monsters the Miniknog produced on this toxic rock? I think you should leave it well alone.",
    "value": "谁知道科学发展部在这颗毒石上培育出了什么样的怪物？我觉得你最好别去碰它。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration04b/senderName",
    "raw": "Nuru",
    "value": "努鲁"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration04b/text",
    "raw": "And I think you sshould pussh the button! Then hunt the horrible monsster which appearss!",
    "value": "我认为你应该按下下下那个按钮！然后去追捕那个出现现现的可怕怪物！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration05/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration05/text",
    "raw": "Remember, avoid the goons in black with visors. You won't be able to hurt them, and their bullets will rip right through your armour. Anyone else is fair game, though.",
    "value": "记住，避开那些戴面罩的黑衣打手。你伤不了他们，而他们的子弹能轻易穿透你的护甲。至于其他人，尽管放手去对付。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration06/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration06/text",
    "raw": "Whoa whoa whoa WHOA, soldier. Get away from the front door - you're not going to be able to force your way into THIS facility.",
    "value": "喂喂喂，士兵，离前门远点 - 你别想着强行闯入这座设施。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration06a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration06a/text",
    "raw": "Head down and rendezvous with Tavish DeGroot; he should be somewhere nearby.",
    "value": "低头前行，与塔维什·德格鲁特会合；他应该就在附近某处。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07/text",
    "raw": "Great job getting in! Now the hard part begins. While you were out, Three-Eyes here started working his magic - how're you doing with those access codes?",
    "value": "干得漂亮，成功进来了！现在真正的挑战开始了。你不在的时候，三只眼已经开始施展他的本事了 - 那些访问码你搞得怎么样了？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07a/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07a/text",
    "raw": "I'll admit I was skeptical when every password was an anagram of 'banana', but they seem to have worked. Their firewall is pretty tough, though.",
    "value": "我得承认，当初每个密码都是“橡胶”的变位词时，我确实心存疑虑，但看起来它们还挺管用。不过，他们的防火墙确实相当坚固。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07b/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07b/text",
    "raw": "I can't remotely assume direct control of the facility's security systems, but I can give you permissions to operate them. Hope that helps.",
    "value": "我无法远程直接接管设施的安全系统控制权，但我可以授予你操作权限。希望这能帮到你。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07c/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration07c/text",
    "raw": "Remember, you can't fight the goons in black directly. You'll have to find alternative ways to dispose of them - be creative.",
    "value": "记住，不要直接与那些穿黑衣的打手正面冲突。你得另辟蹊径，用巧妙的方法解决他们 - 发挥你的创造力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration08/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration08/text",
    "raw": "This must be the main fabrication plant. Hmm, I'm picking up signals from a couple of goons ahead; this could be problematic.",
    "value": "这肯定是主要制造工厂。嗯，我探测到前方有几个打手发出的信号；这可能会有点麻烦。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration08a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration08a/text",
    "raw": "There ought to be some way to dispose of them. One of the drawbacks of the prototype armour is that they can't run very fast in it.",
    "value": "总该有办法处理掉它们。原型装甲的一个缺点就是穿着它时无法快速奔跑。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration09/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration09/text",
    "raw": "Well, here we are. This must be where the research team lives and works, designing tools of cruel oppression, no doubt knowing what they're doing...",
    "value": "好吧，我们到了。这里想必就是研究团队生活和工作的地方，设计着残酷压迫的工具，他们无疑清楚自己在做什么..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration09a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/infiltration09a/text",
    "raw": "...Silence them all.",
    "value": "...让他们全都闭嘴。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple01/text",
    "raw": "My database indicates this temple is suspended over a gas giant. Falling will result in your death. The triple jump, while not essential, will be exceedingly useful.",
    "value": "我的数据库显示这座神庙悬浮在一颗气态巨行星之上。坠落将导致死亡。三段跳虽非必需，但会极其有用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple01a/text",
    "raw": "What will be required, though, is a grappling hook. Please head back and collect one if you do not have this item.",
    "value": "不过，你需要准备一个抓钩。如果你没有这件物品，请返回去取一个。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02/text",
    "raw": "Oh? You have been given permission to tour the Sky Boulevard? I'm impressed! It's one of the most sacred sites off Avos!",
    "value": "哦？你获得了参观空之林道的许可？真让人刮目相看！那可是阿沃斯之外最神圣的圣地之一！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02a/text",
    "raw": "Here, suspended with the power of avolite crystals, we can be the closest to the aether - and Kluex himself! Gosh, isn't he mighty?",
    "value": "在这里，借助阿沃斯水晶的力量悬浮，我们能最大限度地接近以太 - 乃至克鲁西斯本尊！天哪，他难道不强大吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02b/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02b/text",
    "raw": "Old habits die hard, don't they? He still thinks you're a tourist...",
    "value": "旧习难改，是吧？他还是把你当成游客..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02c/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02c/text",
    "raw": "Did you say something, Madame Bright?",
    "value": "布莱特夫人，您刚才说了什么吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02d/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple02d/text",
    "raw": "Uh, no, dear?",
    "value": "额，不，亲爱的？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple03/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple03/text",
    "raw": "Blessed with powers from Kluex himself, Avos' greatest warriors are sent to the grand temples as guardians! I'm sure you'll find them strong and friendly!",
    "value": "受克鲁西斯亲自赐福，阿沃斯最强大的战士们被派往宏伟神殿担任守护者！相信你一定会感受到他们的强大与友善！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple03a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple03a/text",
    "raw": "But what's really exciting is that you're likely to meet not just one, but multiple stargazers! Oh, if only I could meet such important personages!",
    "value": "但真正令人兴奋的是，你很可能不止遇到一位，而是多位观星者！啊，要是我能遇见这样的大人物该多好！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple04/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple04/text",
    "raw": "Wow! A stargazer's ship! I'd heard of them, but never seen one! You're being invited on board? I'm so jealous!",
    "value": "哇！一艘观星者的飞船！我听说过，但从未亲眼见过！你被邀请上船了？我太羡慕了！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple05/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple05/text",
    "raw": "Oh! This is the grand observatory! From here, the Stargazers peer into the heavens and study the aether with great diligence!",
    "value": "哦！这就是那座宏伟的天文台！从这里，观星者们凝望苍穹，孜孜不倦地研究着以太的奥秘！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple05a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple05a/text",
    "raw": "We believe that by studying Kluex's great creations, we can learn more about the deity himself and the way he works!",
    "value": "我们相信，通过研究克鲁西斯的伟大创造，我们能更深入地了解这位神明本身及其行事之道！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple05b/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple05b/text",
    "raw": "After all, does the pot not reflect upon the potter's intentions and spirit?",
    "value": "毕竟，陶罐不也映照着陶匠的匠心与神韵吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple06/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple06/text",
    "raw": "Oh! This is a kinetic orb cannon! They're great artifacts left to us by Kluex himself!",
    "value": "哦！这是一门动能轨道炮！这可是克鲁西斯亲自留给我们的伟大遗物！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple06a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple06a/text",
    "raw": "We're not exactly sure what they're intended for...so we rigged them up to transport people instead!",
    "value": "我们不太确定它们原本的用途...所以我们就改装了一下，用来运送人员了！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple06b/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple06b/text",
    "raw": "Stand on the platform and make a small leap. A SMALL leap. It's like flying!",
    "value": "站在平台上，轻轻一跃。只是轻轻一跃。感觉就像在飞翔！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple07/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple07/text",
    "raw": "Oh my. Look at that trap ahead, dear. It seems particularly deadly.",
    "value": "哎呀，亲爱的，你看前面那个陷阱，看起来特别致命。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple07a/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple07a/text",
    "raw": "Do you see that crystal battery over there? My hunch is that it powers the trap. Please smash it and see what happens.",
    "value": "看到那边的水晶电池了吗？我猜它是陷阱的能量源。请砸碎它，看看会发生什么。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple08/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple08/text",
    "raw": "These here are bounce pads. They're hardly as strong as a kinetic orb cannon, but will keep you aloft...if bouncy.",
    "value": "这些是弹跳垫。虽然远不及动能球炮的威力，但能让你保持悬浮...当然，弹跳感十足。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple09/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple09/text",
    "raw": "Please stop and listen! The inscriptions ahead are important! Let me translate:",
    "value": "请停下脚步，仔细聆听！前方的碑文至关重要！让我来为你解读："
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple09a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple09a/text",
    "raw": "'A test of the mind for the faithful. If the wrong levers are thrown when the console is activated, you will surely be destroyed.'",
    "value": "“对忠诚者的心智考验。若在启动控制台时扳错拉杆，你必将毁灭。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple09b/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple09b/text",
    "raw": "'In the next room, throw down two.'",
    "value": "“在隔壁房间，扔下两个。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple10/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple10/text",
    "raw": "'In this room, throw down three without three to make eight.'",
    "value": "“在这间房间，扔下三个没有三来凑成八。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple11/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple11/text",
    "raw": "'In this room, throw down four without four to make twelve.'",
    "value": "“在这间房间，放下四个没有四的，凑成十二。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12/text",
    "raw": "It looks like the temple ends here, yet this doesn't feel right...",
    "value": "看起来寺庙到这里就结束了，但这感觉不太对劲..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12a/text",
    "raw": "Of course not! This is the test of faith: step out into the aether, friend, and Kluex himself will bear you across the sky!",
    "value": "当然不是！这是信仰的考验：踏入以太吧，朋友，克鲁西斯将亲自承载你翱翔天际！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12b/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12b/text",
    "raw": "What?",
    "value": "什么？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12c/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple12c/text",
    "raw": "Yes! Is it not written. 'Kluex himself will carry the faithful to the skies'? Step out over the edge without fear, friend!",
    "value": "“是的！难道经文上没写着吗？“克鲁西斯将亲自引领信徒飞升天际”？朋友，无需畏惧，勇敢地迈出那一步吧！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple13/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple13/text",
    "raw": "I...I don't believe this. There shouldn't be any forces holding you up. And yet...",
    "value": "我...我无法相信。按理说没有任何力量能支撑住你。然而..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple13a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple13a/text",
    "raw": "It is the force of faith itself! Kluex empowers the unshakeable!",
    "value": "这正是信仰之力！克鲁西斯赋予坚定不移者以力量！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple14/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple14/text",
    "raw": "And so your pilgrimage ends. Here, in the heavens, one is the closest to Kluex as one can be.",
    "value": "于是，你的朝圣之旅在此终结。在这天堂之中，你与克鲁西斯的距离，已近无可近。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple14a/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple14a/text",
    "raw": "From here, one may view the aether, from here, one may view boundless eternity and realise one's smallness in Kluex's vast glory.",
    "value": "由此处，可窥见以太之息，可望见无垠的永恒，于克鲁西斯的浩瀚荣光中，方知自身之渺小。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple14b/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/skytemple14b/text",
    "raw": "Please, let's take a moment to meditate on what you went through to get here, and what you have learned.",
    "value": "请花一点时间，静心回想你一路走来的经历，以及从中领悟到的智慧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs01/text",
    "raw": "Preliminary scans suggest that the sonic sphere will be essential here. If you have not already done so, please equip it at the nearby console.",
    "value": "初步扫描显示，音速球在此处至关重要。若您尚未装备，请前往附近控制台进行配置。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs02/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs02/text",
    "raw": "I...remember reading about this. Before Earth's demise, a Protectorate division was dispatched here to investigate a distress signal. None of them returned.",
    "value": "我....记得我读到过这段记载。在地球毁灭之前，曾有一支守护团分队被派往此地，调查一则求救信号。他们无人生还。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs02a/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs02a/text",
    "raw": "The facility appears to under lockdown. If we can find survivors, however unlikely, that would be a great relief.",
    "value": "该设施似乎处于封锁状态。若能找到幸存者，哪怕希望渺茫，也将是莫大的慰藉。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs03/senderName",
    "raw": "The Baron",
    "value": "拜伦男爵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs03/text",
    "raw": "Sarcastic. Well, isn't this a lovely sight.",
    "value": "讽刺。呵，这景象可真是“赏心悦目”啊。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs03a/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs03a/text",
    "raw": "...We mustn't give up hope.",
    "value": "...我们绝不能放弃希望。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs04/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs04/text",
    "raw": "Hey, it's Letheia Cola! Anyone have any pixels?",
    "value": "嘿，是莱西亚可乐！有人有像素吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs04a/senderName",
    "raw": "Nuru",
    "value": "努鲁"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs04a/text",
    "raw": "...Do you even know what that sstuff doess to your inssidess, Fisshface?",
    "value": "...你知不知道那玩意儿对你内脏有什么影响响响，鱼脸？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs05/text",
    "raw": "This server appears to have important data marked out on it. If you find other servers marked out with lava lamps, I will be able to read their data.",
    "value": "这台服务器上似乎标记了重要数据。如果你发现其他服务器旁有熔岩灯标记，我就能读取它们的数据。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs05a/text",
    "raw": "'The organic samples arrived today from Anomalous Materials. We're very excited to work with them; the administrator has moved up the testing schedule.'",
    "value": "“有机样本今天已从异常材料部门送达。我们非常期待与它们合作；管理员已将测试日程提前。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs05b/text",
    "raw": "'These are nothing like we've ever seen before. Almost...no. If we succeed here, we're all getting promotions. This could be the discovery of the millennium.'",
    "value": "“这些发现与我们以往所见截然不同。几乎可以说是...不，如果我们在此取得成功，所有人都将获得晋升。这或许会是千年一遇的重大发现。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs06/text",
    "raw": "Restoring corrupted data...reading...",
    "value": "正在恢复损坏的数据...读取中..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs06a/text",
    "raw": "'We've cleared all nonessential vats for the project. Doubling times are far lower than expected; the biomass reproduces at an astounding rate. We need to find a way to effectively control this thing.'",
    "value": "“我们已经为项目清除了所有非必要的培养槽。倍增时间远低于预期；生物质以惊人的速度繁殖。我们必须找到有效控制这东西的方法。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs06b/text",
    "raw": "'Even more interesting is that despite being only one sample, it appears to code for several different creatures...we'll need to look into this. It's a bit worrying.'",
    "value": "“更有趣的是，尽管这只是一个样本，它似乎编码了多种不同的生物....我们需要深入调查一下。这有点令人担忧。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs07/text",
    "raw": "You have discovered a Steele Tech Mk-5 Mounted Plasma Gatling. This powerful weapon is incredibly devastating to anything caught in its line of fire.",
    "value": "你发现了一台斯蒂尔科技Mk-5型车载等离子加特林。这款威力强大的武器，任何处于其火力范围内的目标都将遭受毁灭性打击。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs07a/text",
    "raw": "However, it is stationary, and requires a recharge of about five seconds before it can be activated again. The blue ready light atop the chassis indicates charge status.",
    "value": "然而，该设备是固定式的，每次激活后需充电约五秒才能再次使用。机身上的蓝色就绪指示灯会显示充电状态。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs07b/text",
    "raw": "Please utilise this weapon judiciously, as I suspect you will need it soon. Several lifesigns are converging on your location.",
    "value": "请审慎使用这件武器，我预感你很快会需要它。多个生命信号正朝你的位置聚集。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs08/text",
    "raw": "The path forks here. Both will place you in peril. I commend your bravery in the face of vicious alien life and wish you good luck.",
    "value": "前路在此分岔，两条皆通向险境。我钦佩你面对凶险异星生命的勇气，并祝你一路好运。"
