    "raw": "I once ssaw a holo-movie; it had an alien that could go anywhere it wanted via crawling through ventss. It also sstabbed thingss with itss tail.",
    "value": "我曾看过一部全息息息电影，里面有个外星星星生物，能通过通风管道爬行行行去任何地方。它还会用尾巴刺穿东西。"
