    "path": "/lethialabs16/text",
    "raw": "Restoring corrupted data...reading...",
    "value": "正在恢复损坏的数据...读取中..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs16a/text",
    "raw": "'Vaughn, are you out of your mind? You talked to Alisa about your findings?! I told you clearly, no one outside Letheia is allowed to know what you're doing down there! You know what a gossip she is!'",
    "value": "“沃恩，你疯了吗？你居然把发现告诉艾丽莎了？！我明明告诉过你，除了莱西亚内部的人，绝不能让任何人知道你在下面的行动！你又不是不知道她有多爱传闲话！”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs16b/text",
    "raw": "'To make things worse, things are getting out of hand; it's spreading. How the hell did they get to the aquarium? And what's going on in the dorms?'",
    "value": "“更糟的是，情况正在失控；它在蔓延。他们到底是怎么跑到水族馆去的？宿舍那边又发生了什么？”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs17/text",
    "raw": "Restoring corrupted data...reading...",
    "value": "正在恢复损坏的数据...读取中..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs17a/text",
    "raw": "'Pete, the fish are looking pretty sickly. I think there's something in the water - filters probably got clogged again. I'll be down the maintenance hatch all day Tuesday, just FYI.'",
    "value": "“皮特，这些鱼看起来状态不太好。我怀疑水质有问题 - 可能是过滤器又堵了。周二我一整天都会在检修口那边忙活，先跟你说一声。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs18/text",
    "raw": "Restoring corrupted data...reading...",
    "value": "正在恢复损坏的数据...读取中..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs18a/text",
    "raw": "'Hey, Backy - have you seen my cat? I know she likes to wander around, but I haven't seen her for a couple days now. Starting to get worried.'",
    "value": "“嘿，贝基 - 你看见我的猫了吗？我知道她喜欢到处溜达，可我已经好几天没见着她了，开始有点担心了。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs19/text",
    "raw": "Restoring corrupted data...reading...",
    "value": "正在恢复损坏的数据...读取中..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs19a/text",
    "raw": "'We've run the numbers; there's no doubt about it. All models for growth, lifespan and metabolism only work when applied across the entire population, rather than to individuals.'",
    "value": "“我们已经进行了数据分析，结果确凿无疑。所有关于增长、寿命和新陈代谢的模型，只有在应用于整个群体而非个体时，才具有实际意义。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs19b/text",
    "raw": "'In some ways, they're like advanced hive insects, a single advanced superorganism. There seems to be something giving them purpose, but I can't determine what. Containment is vital.'",
    "value": "“从某些方面看，他们就像高度进化的集群昆虫，一个单一的、先进超级生命体。似乎有某种力量在赋予他们目标，但我无法确定那是什么。实施收容至关重要。”"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs19c/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs19c/text",
    "raw": "They couldn't have known, could they? No, they couldn't. But how could Letheia have acquired Ruin biomass before Earth's...incident?",
    "value": "他们不可能知道，对吧？不，他们不可能。但莱西亚是如何在地球的...事件发生前就获得了祸的生物质？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs20/senderName",
    "raw": "Nuru",
    "value": "努鲁"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs20/text",
    "raw": "Thiss place iss WRONG. Jusst looking at it makess me feel ill.",
    "value": "这个地方不对劲。光是看着它，就让我感到一阵恶心心心。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21/senderName",
    "raw": "Tonauac",
    "value": "图南瓦克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21/text",
    "raw": "...Kluex above. A complete slaughter.",
    "value": "...克鲁西斯在上。这是一场彻底的屠杀。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21a/senderName",
    "raw": "The Baron",
    "value": "拜伦男爵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21a/text",
    "raw": "Concerned. Are you all right, Lady Bright? You appear to be shaking quite intensely.",
    "value": "关切。您还好吗，布莱特女士？您看起来抖得相当厉害。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21b/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21b/text",
    "raw": "No, no...I'm...I'm fine. I've come to terms with it. There are no survivors. And I had dared to hope.",
    "value": "不，不...我...我没事。我已经接受了这个事实。没有幸存者。而我竟还曾抱有一丝希望。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21c/text",
    "raw": "I must beg your attention. I have located the coolant system for this facility's fusion reactor nearby to the west. There is a manual override to shut down the coolant pumps.",
    "value": "我必须请您注意。我已在此设施西侧附近找到了聚变反应堆的冷却系统。那里有一个手动操作装置，可用于关闭冷却泵。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21d/text",
    "raw": "If you allow the reactor to overheat, there is a 100% chance it will explode, burning this moon and all Ruin biomass.",
    "value": "如果你让反应堆过热，它有100%的几率会爆炸，烧毁这颗卫星以及所有祸的生物质。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21e/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21e/text",
    "raw": "That appears to be our best chance, dear. Since there're no survivors, this place MUST be destroyed.",
    "value": "亲爱的，看来这是我们最好的机会了。既然没有幸存者，这个地方必须被摧毁。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21f/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21f/text",
    "raw": "Hmph. Burning the planet? I say we should nuke it from orbit. That's the only way to be sure.",
    "value": "哼。烧掉这颗星球？要我说，就该从轨道上直接核平它。这样才能万无一失。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs21g/text",
    "raw": "Please proceed into the room ahead; I will instruct you further there.",
    "value": "请进入前方的房间，我将在那里进一步指示你。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs22/text",
    "raw": "It would appear that the protectors tried to make a stand here. The door to the coolant systems is lacking power, but it can be restored through the console ahead.",
    "value": "看起来守护者们曾试图在此处坚守。通往冷却系统的大门电力中断，但可以通过前方的控制台恢复供电。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs22a/text",
    "raw": "I estimate it will take about 90 seconds for adequate power to be restored to the door. Additionally, I detect an immense number of lifesigns converging upon your position.",
    "value": "我估计大约需要90秒才能为门恢复足够的电力。此外，我检测到大量生命信号正朝你的位置聚集。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs22b/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs22b/text",
    "raw": "It knows what you intend, dear, and will do everything in its power to stop you.",
    "value": "亲爱的，它洞悉你的意图，并会竭尽全力阻止你。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs22c/text",
    "raw": "Please prepare yourself before you activate the console. Judicious and effective use of the Steele Tech Plasma Gatlings will be essential to your survival.",
    "value": "在启动控制台前，请务必做好准备。明智且高效地使用斯蒂尔科技等离子加特林，将是你生存的关键。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs22d/text",
    "raw": "Remember that this facility has no checkpoint; if your position is overrun, you will likely perish. I commend your bravery. Good luck.",
    "value": "记住，这个设施没有检查点；一旦你的阵地失守，很可能就会丧命。我钦佩你的勇气。祝你好运。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/lethialabs23/text",
    "raw": "This is button for the manual override; please depress it. I will delay the shutdown until you safely evacuate. There will be no timed escape sequence.",
    "value": "这是手动控制按钮，请按下它。我会延迟关闭系统，直到你们安全撤离。不会有定时逃生程序启动。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase01/senderName",
    "raw": "The Baron",
    "value": "拜伦男爵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase01/text",
    "raw": "Nostalgic. This tower blights the land, a bastion of villainy where cruel warlords hoard stolen wealth and train their armies. I encountered many in my youth.",
    "value": "怀旧。这座塔楼玷污了大地，是邪恶的堡垒，残暴的军阀在此囤积掠夺的财富，训练他们的军队。我年少时曾多次途经此地。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase01a/senderName",
    "raw": "The Baron",
    "value": "拜伦男爵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase01a/text",
    "raw": "Noble. Ascend the tower, O protector, and cast the vicious warlord from its top!",
    "value": "高尚。守护者啊，请登临高塔之巅，将那凶残的军阀从塔顶掷下！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase02/text",
    "raw": "The warlord's minions appear to have taken prisoners; they may join you if you free them. You will need all the help you can get.",
    "value": "军阀的手下似乎抓了些俘虏；若你解救他们，或许能获得他们的加入。毕竟，多一份力量总是好的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase03/text",
    "raw": "My scans suggest a 76% chance of this switch being important. You should disable it.",
    "value": "我的扫描结果显示，这个开关有76%的可能性至关重要。建议你将其关闭。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
