  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase06/text",
    "raw": "Oh look. More fire. Of course it hass to be fire! Why am I not ssurprissed?",
    "value": "哦，看哪。又是火。当然得是是是火！我怎么一点都不惊讶呢？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase06a/senderName",
    "raw": "Nuru",
    "value": "努鲁"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase06a/text",
    "raw": "Allow me to expresss my infinite gratitude that it iss you and not me who iss down there.",
    "value": "请允许许许我表达无尽的感激，幸幸幸好是你而不是我在那里。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase07/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase07/text",
    "raw": "I simply do not understand such architecture. Who would build deadly traps in their home? What sort of twisted mind would live in such a place?",
    "value": "我实在无法理解这样的建筑。谁会在自己家里设置致命的陷阱？究竟是怎样扭曲的心灵才会选择居住在这样的地方？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase07a/senderName",
    "raw": "The Baron",
    "value": "拜伦男爵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase07a/text",
    "raw": "Amused. Don't judge, lad. Some people take great joy in turning a trip to the washroom into a matter of life and death!",
    "value": "有趣。别急着下结论，小伙子。有些人就是能把上厕所这件事搞得像生死攸关一样，还乐在其中呢！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase07b/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase07b/text",
    "raw": "I fail to see the humour in your words.",
    "value": "我听看出你的话幽默在哪。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase08/senderName",
    "raw": "The Baron",
    "value": "拜伦男爵"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase08/text",
    "raw": "Appalled. This warlord has been holding such lovely damsels hostage! If only I were younger, I would be down there with you!",
    "value": "震惊。这个军阀竟扣押了如此可爱的姑娘们！若我再年轻些，定会与你们并肩作战！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase09/senderName",
    "raw": "Koichi",
    "value": "光一"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase09/text",
    "raw": "For villains and thugs, these people are certainly well-read.",
    "value": "对于恶棍和暴徒来说，这些人确实算得上是饱读诗书了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase09a/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase09a/text",
    "raw": "Even enemies may have something to teach us, dear.",
    "value": "亲爱的，即便是敌人，也可能有值得我们学习之处。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase10/text",
    "raw": "It is dark. You are likely to be eaten by a grue.",
    "value": "天黑了。你可能会被一只格鲁兽吃掉。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase11/text",
    "raw": "You have discovered an extremely well-hidden secret. Congratulations are in order.",
    "value": "你发现了一个隐藏极深的秘密。值得庆贺。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase11a/text",
    "raw": "The mod creator salutes your dedication to finding the secrets he has hidden in his creations. In finding and reaching this place, you've proven yourself worthy.",
    "value": "模组创作者向您致敬，感谢您如此执着地探寻他隐藏在作品中的秘密。能够找到并抵达此地，已证明您配得上这份殊荣。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase11b/text",
    "raw": "He also hopes you have as much fun playing Extra Dungeons as he did in making all these missions for you to enjoy! Please, stay awhile and rest before moving along!",
    "value": "他也希望你在游玩“额外地牢”模组时，能像他为你精心设计这些任务时一样充满乐趣！请在此稍作停留，休息片刻再继续前行吧！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase12/text",
    "raw": "Warning! You should not attempt to evade this trap unless you have the sonic sphere equipped!",
    "value": "警告！除非你已装备音速球，否则切勿尝试规避此陷阱！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/volcanobase13/text",
    "raw": "We're on a rail, on a rail, on a rail...",
    "value": "我们在路上，路上，路上..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders01/text",
    "raw": "We've arrived! This looks like a proper rustic backwater, all right.",
    "value": "我们到了！这地方看起来确实是个地道的乡野小镇，没错。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders01a/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders01a/text",
    "raw": "Keeping peace in the galaxy is what the Protectorate is about, dear. Apprehending this criminal would certainly show we're up and about, if nothing else.",
    "value": "亲爱的，守护团的职责就是维护宇宙的和平。即便没有其他理由，逮捕这名罪犯至少能证明我们正在积极行动。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders02/text",
    "raw": "You might want to talk to the locals and stock up on supplies before heading out. We won't be able to return once we leave the fort.",
    "value": "出发前，你最好和当地人聊聊，备足补给。一旦离开堡垒，我们就无法再回来了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders03/text",
    "raw": "The path forks here. The hillside is likely a straightforward path, but teeming with enemies. The mines are more treacherous, but you'll face less resistance.",
    "value": "道路在此分岔。山坡那条路可能较为平坦，但敌人密布；矿洞则更为险峻，不过遭遇的阻碍会少一些。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders04/text",
    "raw": "What a treasure trove! We're rich! We're rich!",
    "value": "真给你找到宝啦！我们发财了！有钱赚啦！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders05/text",
    "raw": "Going up the hill was hard enough...now we have to go DOWN? Give me a break!",
    "value": "上山已经够难了...现在还得下山？饶了我吧！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders06/text",
    "raw": "Hank's men have dug into the hill with fortifications and traps. Hope you're confident enough in your combat abilities to bust their barricade!",
    "value": "汉克的手下已在山丘上布下防御工事和陷阱。希望你对自身的战斗能力有足够信心，能够一举突破他们的封锁！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders07/text",
    "raw": "Stop right there, criminal scum! Nobody breaks the law on my watch!",
    "value": "站住，你这犯罪的渣滓！在我眼皮底下，没人能违法！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders07a/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/sunsetriders07a/text",
    "raw": "I'm really sorry about the AI. The programming team was having a rather...unique day when they were coding the humour module.",
    "value": "对于AI的表现，我深感抱歉。编程团队在编写幽默模块时，那天他们的状态有些...特别。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash01/text",
    "raw": "This hatch looks interesting; there ought to be a way to open it nearby. Search the cavern thoroughly.",
    "value": "这个舱口看起来挺有意思；附近应该能找到打开它的方法。仔细搜查一下洞穴。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash02/text",
    "raw": "Behind you! Run!",
    "value": "小心身后！快跑！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash03/text",
    "raw": "The door's locked, but I see an open window you could get in by.",
    "value": "门锁着，但我看到一扇开着的窗户，你可以从那儿进去。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash04/text",
    "raw": "I have a bad feeling about this...",
    "value": "我有种不祥的预感..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash05/text",
    "raw": "The gate switch's in the far guard tower - look, you can see it through the window. It's too small to climb in through, though...",
    "value": "大门的开关在远处的哨塔里 - 看，透过窗户就能看见。不过窗户太小了，根本钻不进去..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash06/text",
    "raw": "Great job! Let's move on - the Commissar's home is bound to be crawling with guards.",
    "value": "干得漂亮！我们继续前进 - 政委的住所肯定布满了守卫。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash06a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash06a/text",
    "raw": "Commissar Vonel's officers are dangerous foes, as you've probably experienced by now. Be careful.",
    "value": "正如你可能已经领教过的，沃内尔政委的部下都是危险的敌人，务必小心。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash07/text",
    "raw": "Brr, it's cold! I hope you wrapped up well!",
    "value": "哎呀，好冷！希望你已经穿得暖暖和和的了！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash07a/senderName",
    "raw": "Lana Blake",
    "value": "拉娜·布莱克"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/snowcrash07a/text",
    "raw": "Commissar Vonel is a high-value target; his mountain facility and dacha are bound to be well-guarded. Eliminating him will deal a serious blow to the Miniknog's logistics operations.",
    "value": "沃内尔政委是高价值目标，其山间设施与乡间别墅必定戒备森严。若能将其清除，将对科技发展部的后勤运作造成沉重打击。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/grandarena01/text",
    "raw": "Remember what the hunter said - if you die, you'll have to start all over again! Give the florans 15 minutes or so to reset the arena, and then you can make another attempt.",
    "value": "记住猎人的话 - 如果你死了，就得从头再来！给叶族人15分钟左右重置竞技场，然后你就可以再次尝试了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/grandarena01a/text",
    "raw": "There're also some monsters left over from the last battle - mop them up before you start, okay?",
    "value": "上次战斗还剩下一些怪物 - 在开始前先清理掉它们，好吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple01/text",
    "raw": "The front of the temple looks to be heavily guarded. Perhaps another route inside is available? We could avoid direct confrontation.",
    "value": "寺庙正面似乎戒备森严。或许有其他路径可以进入？我们可以避免正面冲突。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple01fu/text",
    "raw": "There must be something valuable here if it is actively patrolled. We should press on and see what secrets await.",
    "value": "既然有巡逻，这里肯定藏有价值不菲的东西。我们得继续前进，看看究竟隐藏着什么秘密。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple02/text",
    "raw": "This gate is locked. I wonder if there's a way to open it somewhere...",
    "value": "这扇门锁住了。不知道附近有没有能打开它的方法..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple02fu/text",
    "raw": "Okay...mayhem and death it is, then. Enjoy.",
    "value": "好吧...那就让混乱与死亡降临吧。请尽情享受。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple03/text",
    "raw": "Such a beautiful place, flourishing under the desert! Such specialized ecosystems are always a joy to explore.",
    "value": "如此美丽的地方，竟在沙漠之下生机盎然！探索这些独特的生态系统总是令人心旷神怡。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple03fu/text",
    "raw": "A wise choice! They won't see us coming now. Of course, it's also dark and creepy and likely full of nasty surprises. Use caution.",
    "value": "明智之选！他们现在不会发现我们的行踪。当然，这里又黑又诡异，很可能藏着不少糟糕的意外。务必小心行事。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple04/text",
    "raw": "Now what is this we have here? Keep an eye out for secrets such as these. I expect you'll find many such hidden gems across the galaxy.",
    "value": "瞧瞧我们发现了什么？留意这类秘密。相信你会在宇宙各处发现许多这样的隐藏宝藏。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple04fu/text",
    "raw": "I don't know...this gives me a bad feeling.",
    "value": "我不知道...这让我有种不祥的预感。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple05/text",
    "raw": "Looks like you'll need someone helpful to hold down this button for you while you enter through the door.",
    "value": "看来你需要一个帮手，在你进门时帮你按住这个按钮。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple05fu/text",
    "raw": "More secret passages...this had better be worth it.",
    "value": "更多的秘密通道...但愿这趟冒险物有所值。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple06fu/text",
    "raw": "Oh, come on! Who builds something like this? I mean...really!?!",
    "value": "哎呀，拜托！谁会造出这种东西啊？我是说...真的假的？！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple07fu/text",
    "raw": "Let's just fill this hall with frikkin' ^red;LAVA^reset;. No big deal, guys. And then let's make the ground vanish at random! Team players, these.",
    "value": "咱们干脆把这大厅灌满该死的^red;岩浆^reset;吧，小事一桩。然后再让地面随机消失！真是群“团队合作”的好手。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple08fu/text",
    "raw": "Finally. I think we may be clear of evil, deadly traps. We may even walk out of here ^orange;RICH^reset;!",
    "value": "终于。我想我们可能已经摆脱了那些邪恶致命的陷阱。说不定我们还能^orange;满载而归^reset;，从这里走出去！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ancienttemple06/text",
    "raw": "Ugh, look at all that slime. I don't envy you...",
    "value": "唉，看看这满地的黏液。真替你感到难受。..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/forestoffae01/text",
    "raw": "What a beautiful sight! By the by, did you remember to bring a grappling hook? There's still time to turn back and get one if you forgot.",
    "value": "多么壮丽的景色！对了，你记得带抓钩了吗？如果忘了，现在回去拿还来得及。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/forestoffae02/text",
    "raw": "These must be the cultists we were warned about. I'm sure there're more of them in the forest.",
    "value": "这些肯定就是之前警告过我们的邪教徒。我敢肯定森林里还有更多他们的人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/forestoffae03/text",
    "raw": "Did the cultists set this trap?",
    "value": "这些邪教徒设下了这个陷阱吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/forestoffae04/text",
    "raw": "The forest is sending forth its own guardians to fight the cultists. I don't think they recognise that you're trying to help them, though.",
    "value": "森林正派出它的守护者来对抗那些邪教徒。不过，我觉得它们并未意识到你是在试图帮助它们。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/forestoffae05/text",
    "raw": "Keep on your toes. I'm detecting a massive energy signature ahead.",
    "value": "保持警惕。前方探测到巨大的能量信号。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/forestoffae06/text",
    "raw": "They really have been busy corrupting the forest, haven't they?",
    "value": "他们确实一直在忙着破坏这片森林，不是吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight01/text",
    "raw": "The path forks here. I'm detecting lifesigns on both ends, so take your pick.",
    "value": "这条路在此分岔。我探测到两边都有生命迹象，你自己挑吧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight02/text",
    "raw": "A frog village. How quaint. The locals don't look friendly.",
    "value": "一个蛙族村庄。多么古怪。当地居民看起来并不友善。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight03/text",
    "raw": "This hatch seems to lead into some ruins. Maybe you should check around town to see if the locals have rigged some controls up.",
    "value": "这个舱口似乎通往一处废墟。或许你该在镇上打听一下，看看当地人是否设置了什么控制装置。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight04/text",
    "raw": "The door's locked, and the switch is on the inside of the bell tower. Is there a way to trigger, or failing that, destroy it?",
    "value": "门锁着，开关在钟楼内部。有没有办法触发它，或者实在不行，能不能把它破坏掉？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight05/text",
    "raw": "Cultists! Just what are they doing here?",
    "value": "邪教徒！他们到底在这里做什么？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight06/text",
    "raw": "This frog looks pretty lonely, I think he'd like your company.",
    "value": "这只青蛙看起来挺孤单的，我想它会喜欢有你作伴。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight07/text",
    "raw": "Well, that was quite the sticky situation. Are you all right?",
    "value": "嗯，那确实是个棘手的局面。你还好吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight08/text",
    "raw": "This is an interesting one. Do you have a rocket launcher that can do guided rockets? I don't think you'll be able to reach the switch otherwise.",
    "value": "这倒是有趣。你手头有能发射制导火箭的火箭筒吗？不然我觉得你够不到那个开关。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight09/text",
    "raw": "There's no way around it - the console holding the door shut is also connected to the hatch in front of you. I'm sorry, but to proceed you'll need to incinerate the dog.",
    "value": "别无选择 - 控制门关闭的操纵台，同时也连接着你面前的舱门。很抱歉，要继续前进，你必须把那只狗烧成渣。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight10/text",
    "raw": "Oh look, it's this again. To get at all those sweet, sweet pixels you'll need to consign this cat to a slow, painful, needless death.",
    "value": "哦，又来了。想要获取那些诱人的像素点，你就得让这只猫经历一场缓慢、痛苦且毫无必要的死亡。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight11/text",
    "raw": "Do you smell an ambush? Because all that darkness sure does.",
    "value": "你闻到埋伏的气息了吗？因为那片黑暗确实如此。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/evernight12/text",
    "raw": "Oh, I just figured out what else the cat console was linked to - the door you just came through. Good thing you weren't greedy and avoided being bitten in the ass by karma, eh?",
    "value": "哦，我刚弄明白猫猫控制台还连接着什么 - 就是你刚才通过的那扇门。幸好你没贪心，不然可就要被因果报应咬到屁股了，对吧？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/alienjungle01/senderName",
    "raw": "Esther Bright",
    "value": "艾斯特·布莱特"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/alienjungle01/text",
